    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">March 2020. A global pandemic has brought out the worst in some people:</h2><br>After having been kicked out and banned from every store in town for hoarding toilet paper, <br>our typical panic buyer is filled with infinite rage. Roaming all parking lots in search for more shopping carts to plunder.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Toilet Paper Crisis Simulator 2020:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Use this realistic simulation to take control of the typical toilet paper panic hoarder.<br></li><li>Collect asshole points by kicking other people's shopping carts.<br></li><li>Steal as much toilet paper as you can before the time is up.<br></li><li>Enter Rage Mode and enhance your performance by jugging beer.<br></li><li>Defend your loot from the Toilet Paper Bandit.<br></li><li>Beat your own highscores in four levels.<br></li><li>And help us understand this strange behaviour during toilet paper shortages.</li></ul><br>Do you have what it takes to thrive in this crisis?",
